### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8082/health

### 2. List All Orders
GET http://localhost:8082/orders

### 3. Create Order
POST http://localhost:8082/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "p-1",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Get Order by ID
GET http://localhost:8082/orders/ord-1

### 5. Cancel Order
POST http://localhost:8082/orders/ord-1/cancel

### 6. Cancel Order Lagi (Akan Return 409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8082/orders/ord-1/cancel
